#### 6. `Clone_ProducesEqualObject` (line 27–34) — **Missing reference-inequality assertion**

The test verifies field equality but never asserts `clone` is a **different object**. If `Clone()` returned `this`, the test would still pass — defeating the purpose of cloning.

```csharp
